WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:11.268
Hi, I’m Evan Carmichael.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:12.966
Welcome to another edition of Ask Evan.

00:00:13.314 --> 00:00:15.010
In today’s episode I’m going to answer a question

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.491
from one of my forum readers Don

00:00:16.491 --> 00:00:18.317
who wrote in asking about success and he said

00:00:18.791 --> 00:00:20.351
“As an entrepreneur what has been

00:00:20.351 --> 00:00:21.911
your biggest success online?”

00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:23.471
So thanks for the question Don.

00:00:23.905 --> 00:00:25.968
For me, my biggest success I think

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.394
is the launch of evancarmichael.com

00:00:28.655 --> 00:00:30.318
and turning that into a business.

00:00:30.881 --> 00:00:32.672
So when I sold my first software company

00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:34.293
and hooked up with a venture capital company

00:00:34.853 --> 00:00:36.581
I was being asked to do a lot of speaking

00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:37.383
as a young entrepreneur

00:00:37.383 --> 00:00:38.644
kind of success story,

00:00:38.644 --> 00:00:41.145
so I used my website evancarmichael.com

00:00:41.145 --> 00:00:43.027
basically just to say where I was speaking

00:00:43.266 --> 00:00:45.016
and what I was talking about as well

00:00:45.016 --> 00:00:46.904
as share some of the famous entrepreneur profiles

00:00:46.904 --> 00:00:48.377
that I had found helpful

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:50.410
for me when growing my business.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:52.163
People who I’ve modeled their success

00:00:52.357 --> 00:00:54.347
and was able to build a successful company myself as well.

00:00:54.648 --> 00:00:56.636
And that was the launch of the website

00:00:57.075 --> 00:01:00.366
and no matter what I was always going to have that website.

00:01:00.542 --> 00:01:02.366
I felt it was adding value back to people

00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:03.864
who were reading and people would write in

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:06.321
saying that they really love what I wrote

00:01:06.518 --> 00:01:07.449
and it was inspiring

00:01:07.614 --> 00:01:10.342
and motivated them to keep going with their business

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.728
and not give up and you know

00:01:12.861 --> 00:01:14.102
that’s awesome stuff, right?

00:01:14.102 --> 00:01:15.054
That makes me want to keep going

00:01:15.054 --> 00:01:17.301
and doing more and when you get feedback

00:01:17.318 --> 00:01:19.802
like that you know you’re doing something right

00:01:19.976 --> 00:01:20.673
and you’re on the right track.

00:01:21.641 --> 00:01:23.726
It was never intended to be a business at the start.

00:01:23.965 --> 00:01:25.629
It was just something that I did

00:01:25.921 --> 00:01:27.334
as value add to help people out

00:01:29.353 --> 00:01:30.036
and a lot of people helped me

00:01:30.036 --> 00:01:31.214
with my business that I started

00:01:31.638 --> 00:01:32.828
so I wanted to give back

00:01:33.089 --> 00:01:34.731
and it also felt really good

00:01:34.731 --> 00:01:36.373
knowing that you’re helping people.

00:01:36.823 --> 00:01:38.015
And then when I discovered

00:01:38.222 --> 00:01:40.338
‘hey, you know what, we could try some advertising on the website’

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:41.482
and that did well.

00:01:41.847 --> 00:01:44.627
That kind of made the click with the website

00:01:44.856 --> 00:01:47.724
and that started the process for it to become

00:01:48.424 --> 00:01:50.392
my next main business

00:01:50.592 --> 00:01:53.461
and so I transitioned out of the venture capital company

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:57.188
and did my evancarmichael.com stuff on the side

00:01:57.385 --> 00:01:58.352
while at the VC firm

00:01:58.582 --> 00:01:59.372
and when I noticed,

00:01:59.581 --> 00:02:01.729
‘hey, this has some serious revenue opportunities as well.

00:02:02.571 --> 00:02:04.569
If I could do what I’m really excited about

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.058
and make money doing it and help a lot of people

00:02:07.363 --> 00:02:08.782
that’s an awesome formula

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:12.206
and I was able to, you know, leave the venture capital company

00:02:12.444 --> 00:02:14.611
and pursue evancarmichael.com fulltime

00:02:14.932 --> 00:02:15.820
and turned it into a real business.

00:02:16.338 --> 00:02:17.400
And that’s what I’m, you know

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.020
really proud of, really

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:22.040
probably my biggest success online.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.360
We’ve done a lot of little things to make it better

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.297
and better and better on an increasing basis

00:02:26.557 --> 00:02:28.432
every day we try to do things to make the company better

00:02:28.689 --> 00:02:30.775
but from a big picture point of view

00:02:31.044 --> 00:02:33.438
I think being able to launch evancarmichael.com

00:02:33.631 --> 00:02:35.295
and get a lot of people coming to it

00:02:35.535 --> 00:02:36.649
and be able to turn it into a business

00:02:37.146 --> 00:02:38.880
is probably my biggest success online.

00:02:39.171 --> 00:02:41.009
So thanks for the question Don.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.269
If you guys liked the video,

00:02:42.605 --> 00:02:43.657
please give it a thumbs-up.

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:45.497
It makes me want to do more of these videos for you guys

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.677
and if you have a question about success

00:02:48.049 --> 00:02:49.518
or another question for your company

00:02:50.196 --> 00:02:52.038
feel free to leave it in the comments below.

00:02:52.268 --> 00:02:54.121
I always read those and try to respond to as many as I can.

00:02:54.394 --> 00:02:56.558
So thank you and I’ll see you on the next episode.

